      "releaseNotes": "Introducing Vinyl Wall: a new widget to show and play your favorite albums. Pick your favorite music, and it appears on shelves above a beautiful record player. Tap what you want to hear, and the music starts — the record even spins.\n\nWe have also added the ability to tap to advance through images within photo album widgets.",
